#: ../../source/about/index.md:1
msgid "About Telink Semiconductor"
msgstr "关于 Telink Semiconductor"

#: ../../source/about/index.md:3
msgid ""
"**Telink Semiconductor** is a leading fabless semiconductor company "
"dedicated to the design and development of low-power, high-performance "
"wireless connectivity System-on-Chip (SoC) solutions. Founded in 2010 and"
" headquartered in Shanghai, China, Telink has grown to become a global "
"player in the IoT connectivity space."
msgstr ""
"**Telink Semiconductor** 是一家领先的无晶圆半导体公司，致力于设计和开发低功耗、高性能的无线连接片上系统（SoC）解决方案。泰凌微电子成立于 2010 年，总部位于中国上海，已发展成为物联网连接领域的全球参与者。"

#: ../../source/about/index.md:10
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "我们的使命"

#: ../../source/about/index.md:12
msgid ""
"To provide best-in-class wireless connectivity solutions that power the "
"next generation of IoT devices — enabling smarter, more connected, and "
"more energy-efficient products across consumer, industrial, and "
"automotive markets."
msgstr ""
"提供一流的无线连接解决方案，赋能下一代物联网设备——在消费、工业和汽车市场中实现更智能、更互联、更节能的产品。"

#: ../../source/about/index.md:18
msgid "Technology Leadership"
msgstr "技术领先"

#: ../../source/about/index.md:20
msgid ""
"Telink's SoCs integrate a rich set of wireless protocols, offering true "
"multi-protocol support on a single chip:"
msgstr "Telink 的 SoC 集成了丰富的无线协议，在单芯片上提供真正的多协议支持："

